WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:02.160
The city's grain how are the reserves?

00:02.240 --> 00:08.053
Yiyang is originally a strategic stronghold the granaries can supply the entire city's military and civilians for a year or more without problem.

00:08.480 --> 00:12.720
I have ordered people to move all supplies to the southern warehouse.

